Design ideas in the confinement profiles (src/phiward/confine.py) were learned from these
projects, which are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- Anthropic sandbox-runtime (https://github.com/anthropic-experimental/sandbox-runtime):
  denying writes on every folder above a protected path, in both spellings; failing closed when
  a list of allowed places is empty.
- OpenAI Codex CLI (https://github.com/openai/codex): bubblewrap mounts as the main write layer
  on Linux with Landlock as a second layer; a short list of mach services for DNS on macOS;
  write places only from operator config.

No source code was copied from these projects. If code from them is added later, its licence
and copyright notice will be kept with it here.
